# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set Sampler options {#set-sampler-options}"
msgstr "Sampler-Optionen festlegen {#set-sampler-options}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can set options when initializing Sampler, after initializing Sampler, "
"or you can update the options after Sampler has been initialized. For "
"instructions to use these techniques, see the [Introduction to "
"options](/guides/runtime-options-overview#options-precedence) topic.\n"
msgstr ""
"Du kannst Optionen bei der Initialisierung des Sampler festlegen, nach der "
"Initialisierung oder die Optionen nach der Initialisierung aktualisieren. "
"Anleitungen zur Verwendung dieser Techniken findest du im Thema [Einführung "
"in Optionen](/guides/runtime-options-overview#options-precedence).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additionally, you can set the  `shots` value in the `run()` method, as is described in the following section.\n"
"<span id=\"run-method\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""
"Außerdem kannst du den `shots`-Wert in der `run()`-Methode festlegen, wie im folgenden Abschnitt beschrieben.\n"
"<span id=\"run-method\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run() method {#run-method}"
msgstr "Run()-Methode {#run-method}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The only values you can pass to `run()` are those defined in the interface."
"  That is, `shots`. This overwrites any value set for `default_shots` for "
"the current run.\n"
msgstr ""
"Die einzigen Werte, die du an `run()` übergeben kannst, sind die in der "
"Schnittstelle definierten, also `shots`. Dies überschreibt für den aktuellen"
" Lauf jeden Wert, der für `default_shots` festgelegt wurde.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Special cases {#special-cases}"
msgstr "Sonderfälle {#special-cases}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"shots\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"shots\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Shots {#shots}"
msgstr "Shots {#shots}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `SamplerV2.run` method accepts two arguments: a list of PUBs, each of "
"which can specify a PUB-specific value for shots, and a shots keyword "
"argument. These shot values are a part of the Sampler execution interface, "
"and are independent of the Runtime Sampler's options.  They take precedence "
"over any values specified as options in order to comply with the Sampler "
"abstraction.\n"
msgstr ""
"Die Methode `SamplerV2.run` akzeptiert zwei Argumente: eine Liste von PUBs, "
"von denen jeder einen PUB-spezifischen Wert für Shots angeben kann, sowie "
"ein `shots`-Schlüsselwortargument. Diese Shot-Werte sind Teil der Sampler-"
"Ausführungsschnittstelle und unabhängig von den Optionen des Runtime "
"Sampler. Sie haben Vorrang vor allen als Optionen angegebenen Werten, um die"
" Sampler-Abstraktion zu erfüllen.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"However, if `shots` is not specified by any PUB or in the run keyword "
"argument (or if they are all `None`), then the shots value from the options "
"is used, most notably `default_shots`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Wenn `shots` jedoch weder durch einen PUB noch im Run-Schlüsselwortargument "
"angegeben wird (oder wenn alle `None` sind), wird der Shot-Wert aus den "
"Optionen verwendet, insbesondere `default_shots`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To summarize, this is the order of precedence for specifying shots in the "
"Sampler, for any particular PUB:\n"
msgstr ""
"Zusammengefasst gilt für einen bestimmten PUB folgende Prioritätsreihenfolge"
" für die Angabe von Shots im Sampler:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "If the PUB specifies shots, use that value.\n"
msgstr "Wenn der PUB Shots angibt, wird dieser Wert verwendet.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "If the `shots` keyword argument is specified in `run`, use that value.\n"
msgstr ""
"Wenn das `shots`-Schlüsselwortargument in `run` angegeben ist, wird dieser "
"Wert verwendet.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If `twirling` is enabled  (True by default), then the product of "
"`num_randomizations` and `shots_per_randomization`, as specified as  "
"[`twirling` options](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/options-twirling-options), is used.\n"
msgstr ""
"Wenn `twirling` aktiviert ist (standardmäßig True), wird das Produkt aus "
"`num_randomizations` und `shots_per_randomization` verwendet, wie in den "
"[`twirling`-Optionen](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/options-twirling-options) angegeben.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "If `sampler.options.default_shots` is specified, use that value.\n"
msgstr ""
"Wenn `sampler.options.default_shots` angegeben ist, wird dieser Wert "
"verwendet.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Thus, if shots are specified in all possible places, the one with highest "
"precedence (shots specified in the PUB) is used.\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: dropped, JSX/HTML tags differ from English: Wenn Shots also
# an allen möglichen Stellen angegeben werden,
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Although shots specified in the PUB and in `run` have higher precedence, the job fails if `twirling` is enabled and the product of `num_randomizations` and `shots_per_randomization` is smaller than the `shots` value. In this scenario, `SamplerV2` is unable to allocate the shots among the specified `num_randomizations`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: dropped, JSX/HTML tags differ from English: <Admonition
# type="note"> Obwohl im PUB und in `run` angegebe
